+ do fill-window
    - window VirtualWindow
    - domain VirtualSequenceDomain

inner.fill-window(window, domain)
. line = window.sticky-line
=? if line == null
collect-stuck(window, domain, line)
for index in 0 .. < stuck.length
    stick(window, domain, index, stuck[index], stuck-rects[index], stuck-pins[index])

